// "Assemble" [CR#701.45a] is an Unstable keyword action the rules do not
// define, so the declaration has no body and keeps none: Un-sets are out of
// scope. It stays for its spelling alone, which the Vintage-legal Steamflogger
// Boss prints ("would assemble a Contraption"), and english_v3 reads that word
// only through this declaration (`lexeme:keyword_action/assemble`).
KeywordAction(
    name: "assemble",
    spelling: "assemble",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "assemble",
        frame_set: Transitive,
    ),
)
